message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below and cite the original dataset publications listed in DATA_SOURCES.md."
title: "Reference capacity as a hidden threshold: code and processed data for SOH/RUL label-definition shift in public lithium-ion battery datasets"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Jianhao
    affiliation: "School of Materials and Environment, Guangxi Minzu University"
    email: jianhaoyang98@gmail.com
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - lithium-ion battery
  - state of health
  - remaining useful life
  - reference capacity
  - end of life
  - censoring
  - benchmark reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Code, processed data, and supplementary tables for a study of how the
  reference capacity used to define capacity-based state of health changes
  end-of-life thresholds, endpoint censoring, exact point-RUL label
  availability, and SOH benchmark errors in the XJTU and HUST public datasets.
  Associated manuscript: technical brief prepared for the International
  Journal of Prognostics and Health Management.
